---
title: Publish a release
description: A Starlight Markdoc page with steps, a file tree, a link card, and a custom tag.
---

Publish a Mizzen site in three steps.

{% steps %}

1. Build the site:

   ```sh
   node bin/mizzen.ts build site
   ```

2. Check the `site` output folder.
3. Upload the folder to a host.

{% /steps %}

The output looks like this:

{% filetree %}

- site/
  - index.html
  - guides/
    - install/
      - index.html
  - sitemap.xml

{% /filetree %}

Read the [deployment guide](/guides/deploy/) before choosing a host.

{% linkcard title="Deployment guide" href="/guides/deploy/" description="Configure a host, a domain, and caching." /%}

